# NOTICE

dsh-design-playbook is a thin DSH (DeepSeek Harness) bundle package that bridges
the design-playbook package's preview and evidence MCP servers into a DSH profile.

It contains no original logic — only a Cordis patch file (cordis.patch.yml) that
configures @deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client to launch the Python MCP servers shipped in
the `design-playbook` package. All substantive code lives in `design-playbook`.

